00:58:38.160 --> 00:58:42.680
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who says about being a program director,

00:58:42.680 --> 00:58:46.330
<v Dan Savage>It isn't an experiment or a phase. It's a choice.

00:58:46.330 --> 00:58:56.820
